              "locked": false,
              "content": {
                "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">If you've received an appointment letter, search the directory using the name of your scan, treatment or procedure.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Your Nuclear Medicine Department may also provide information specific to your hospital or appointment, so always follow any instructions included with your appointment letter.</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">If you cannot find the information you are looking for, please contact your Nuclear Medicine Department.</span></p></li></ul><p></p>",
